{"recordId":"emperor_元子攸_286954556","name":"元子攸","type":"emperor","dynasty":"南北朝","title":"喋血孤君","canonicalName":null,"aliases":[],"identityStatus":"candidate","candidatePages":[{"title":"魏孝庄帝","pageId":301592,"revisionId":94653294,"revisionTimestamp":"2026-09-29T22:19:00Z","url":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E9%AD%8F%E5%AD%9D%E5%BA%84%E5%B8%9D","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=94653294","wikidataId":"Q1074789","isDisambiguation":false,"bibliography":[{"citationTitle":"資治通鑒","url":null,"type":"named-work","locator":"reference or bibliography section"}],"wikisourceLinks":[],"retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:37:03.563Z","attribution":{"source":"Chinese Wikipedia contributors","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0; bibliography metadata only","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","status":"candidate index, not independently verified evidence"}}],"sourceIds":["source:liangshu","source:weishu"],"reviewIds":[],"claimIds":[],"matches":[{"documentId":"document:liangshu-15f7e16e5de037dc","query":"元子攸","count":1,"offset":4060,"excerpt":"城，拔之，進屠考城，擒魏濟陰王元暉業。\n\n五月戊辰，剋大梁。癸酉，剋虎牢城。魏主元子攸棄洛陽，走河北。乙亥，元顥入洛陽。\n\n六月壬午，大赦天下。辛亥，魏淮陰太守晉鴻以湖陽城內屬。\n\n閏月己未，安右將軍、護軍南康王績薨。己卯，魏尒朱榮攻殺元顥，復據","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:liangshu-3cd3308782690104","query":"元子攸","count":3,"offset":1537,"excerpt":"尒朱吐沒兒單騎獲免。收滎陽儲實，牛馬穀帛不可勝計。進赴虎牢，尒朱世隆棄城走。魏主元子攸懼，奔幷州。其臨淮王元彧、安豊王元延明率百僚，封府庫，備法駕，奉迎顥入洛陽宮，御前殿，改元大赦。顥以慶之爲侍中、車騎大將軍、左光祿大夫，增邑萬戶。魏大將軍上黨王","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:weishu-298d1723bdc0b3ae","query":"元子攸","count":1,"offset":7477,"excerpt":"「侯深」。按當時有兩侯淵，其一，本書卷八０有傳，其人此時在中山，且是尒朱榮黨羽，元子攸不會委任他守北中。又一是侯剛子，卷九三侯剛傳不載，但見於卷二五長孫稚傳補，說是稚之壻。侯剛自稱上谷侯氏，上谷屬燕州，本傳說他請以長子詳為燕州刺史。按照當時以充當","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:weishu-d2bb98a350a9ba55","query":"元子攸","count":1,"offset":5487,"excerpt":"率眾討之　諸本「尚」作「上」。按卷一八臨淮王譚附彧傳以北史補，不載此事，但云彧於元子攸即位後，自梁還，「累除位尚書令」云云。元顥入洛，當仍居此官。這裏「上」顯為「尚」之訛，今改正。〕先護出城拒戰。莊帝還京，嘉其誠節，除使持節、散騎常侍、都督襄廣二","matchType":"name-occurrence"},{"documentId":"document:weishu-e42512fc6bb68966","query":"元子攸","count":1,"offset":13151,"excerpt":"興和中復。〕〔龍亢二漢屬沛晉屬譙國後罷永安三年復屬孝昌中陷興和中復　按「永安」乃元子攸〔孝莊帝〕年號〔五二八－五三０〕，在孝昌〔五二五－五二七〕後，興和〔五三九－五四二〕前。不得先稱「永安三年復」，又稱「孝昌中陷」。疑「永安」乃「永平」之訛。〔永","matchType":"name-occurrence"}],"matchCount":5,"gaps":["身份連結尚未完成編輯核對；同名、異名或同時代關係可能有誤配。","原人物分析及能力數值尚未逐句核對。","來源中的年代、關係與評價仍需逐條轉成有出處的主張。"],"notes":["姓名／重新導向命中，人物身份與每條書目尚須逐項核對。","姓名、分類、時代及稱號保留原庫資料，不自動視為史實。"],"version":"b66c5a60a41e2334","matchedDocuments":[{"id":"document:liangshu-15f7e16e5de037dc","bookId":"book:liangshu","requestedTitle":"梁書/卷03","title":"梁書/卷03","sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%A2%81%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B703","revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/w/index.php?oldid=2401780","historyUrl":"https://zh.wikisource.org/wiki/%E6%A2%81%E6%9B%B8%2F%E5%8D%B703?action=history","revisionId":2401780,"revisionTimestamp":"2024-05-01T07:41:57Z","retrievedAt":"2026-10-02T10:45:02.829Z","sha256":"e9234a36260579030fbd45ef5581f24b4d2ed95c07818d4ee2becfa99a41b3eb","textSha256":"87c0923f69e148341fca4fc5384c6e0f0d7c9cada4355d504ef7476f9948333c","expandedWikitextSha256":"e9234a36260579030fbd45ef5581f24b4d2ed95c07818d4ee2becfa99a41b3eb","characters":15386,"contentPath":"/static/data/history/archive-books/liangshu.json","status":"downloaded","acquisitionStatus":"downloaded","reuse":"Ancient underlying text; Wikisource transcription attribution and CC BY-SA 4.0 for applicable contributions","extraction":"wikitext-conservative-v2.1.0","normalizedAt":"2026-10-02T11:14:37.235Z","upstreamTextQuality":50,"upstreamTextQualityMeaning":"Wikisource platform quality marker; not a percentage of text transcribed","textCompleteness":"not-independently-collated","extractionNotes":["Textquality 50% 是維基文庫平台品質標記，不代表正文已轉錄比例。"],"expandedTransclusionTitles":[],"transclusionIssues":[],"transclusions":[],"textPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a41e2334/documents/40eb57f2f63057631366.json","wikitextPath":"/static/data/history/web/releases/b66c5a60a